{"id":7664,"date":"2024-12-25T09:31:55","date_gmt":"2024-12-25T02:31:55","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/?p=7664"},"modified":"2024-12-25T10:08:39","modified_gmt":"2024-12-25T03:08:39","slug":"topping-off-ceremony-proyek-gedung-fasilitas-pendukung-tlt-tower-1","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/2024\/12\/topping-off-ceremony-proyek-gedung-fasilitas-pendukung-tlt-tower-1\/","title":{"rendered":"Topping off Ceremony Proyek Gedung Fasilitas Pendukung TLT Tower 1"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"7664\" class=\"elementor elementor-7664\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-7289316 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default astroon-bg-container\" data-id=\"7289316\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-76b6efb\" data-id=\"76b6efb\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b777d75 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b777d75\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.16.0 - 09-10-2023 *\/\n.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-stacked .elementor-drop-cap{background-color:#69727d;color:#fff}.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-framed .elementor-drop-cap{color:#69727d;border:3px solid;background-color:transparent}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap{margin-top:8px}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap-letter{width:1em;height:1em}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap{float:left;text-align:center;line-height:1;font-size:50px}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap-letter{display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t<h4><span style=\"font-weight: 500;\"><i>Topping off<\/i> Ceremony Proyek Gedung Fasilitas Pendukung TLT Tower 1<\/span><\/h4>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cdd8519 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"cdd8519\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.16.0 - 09-10-2023 *\/\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"426\" src=\"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/j6oibA7Q-1024x682.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-7690\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/j6oibA7Q-1024x682.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/j6oibA7Q-300x200.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/j6oibA7Q-768x511.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/j6oibA7Q-1536x1022.jpeg 1536w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/j6oibA7Q.jpeg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a156179 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a156179\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Pelaksanaan Topping Off Gedung Fasilitas Pendukung TLT Tower 1 pada tanggal 23 Desember 2024 dihadiri oleh perwakilan dari PT Telkom Indonesia (Persero) Tbk., PT Telekomunikasi Selular, PT Wika Gedung Tbk., PT Pelita Maju Multiswakarsa, PT Ciriajasa Cipta Mandiri, PT Pandega Desain Weharima serta PT Haerte Widya Konsultan Engineering.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e9fe7c6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"e9fe7c6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"359\" src=\"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/toppingoff2-1024x575.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-7692\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/toppingoff2-1024x575.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/toppingoff2-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/toppingoff2-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/toppingoff2.jpg 1178w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ab1e210 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ab1e210\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Dalam sambutannya, Direktur Utama PT Telkom Landmark Tower, Bapak Suratman mengucapkan terima kasih kepada pihak-pihak yang terlibat dalam proses pembangunan sehingga mencapai progress topping off lebih cepat dari target. Selain itu Bapak Suratman mengharapkan dukungan dan doa dari semua pihak agar proyek pembangunan ini dapat berjalan lancar dan diselesaikan tepat waktu.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2c947a3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"2c947a3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"426\" src=\"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/DzCQ615Y-1024x682.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-7684\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/DzCQ615Y-1024x682.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/DzCQ615Y-300x200.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/DzCQ615Y-768x511.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/DzCQ615Y-1536x1022.jpeg 1536w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/DzCQ615Y.jpeg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f5530bd elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f5530bd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Prosesi topping off ditandai dengan penuangan beton pada area lantai roof top, yang diwakili oleh Direktur Utama PT Telkom Landmark Tower Bapak Suratman, Bapak Hadian Pramudita selaku Direktur Utama PT Wika Gedung Tbk, Ibu Notje Rosanti selaku Direktur Investasi Keuangan dan Umum, Bapak Indrawan Ditapradana selaku Direktur Human Capital Management PT Telekomunikasi Selular, Bapak Honesti Basyir selaku Direktur Group Business Development PT Telekom Indonesia (Persero) Tbk, Bapak Junian Sidharta selaku Komisaris Utama PT Telkom Landmark Tower, dan terakhir Bapak Didit Sulistyo sebagai Komisaris PT Telkom Landmark Tower.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a575998 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"a575998\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"426\" src=\"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/QG_ARlCw-1024x682.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-7691\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/QG_ARlCw-1024x682.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/QG_ARlCw-300x200.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/QG_ARlCw-768x511.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/QG_ARlCw-1536x1022.jpeg 1536w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/QG_ARlCw.jpeg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e0e6d76 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e0e6d76\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Acara diakhiri dengan foto di area topping off bersama para tamu undangan. Diharapkan dari acara topping off ini dapat meningkatkan inovasi dalam proyek pembangunan selanjut nya <\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Topping off Ceremony Proyek Gedung Fasilitas Pendukung TLT Tower 1 Pelaksanaan Topping Off Gedung Fasilitas Pendukung TLT Tower 1 pada tanggal 23 Desember 2024 dihadiri oleh perwakilan dari PT Telkom Indonesia (Persero) Tbk., PT Telekomunikasi Selular, PT Wika Gedung Tbk., PT Pelita Maju Multiswakarsa, PT&#8230;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":7690,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_eb_attr":""},"categories":[1],"tags":[],"aioseo_notices":[],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7664"}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=7664"}],"version-history":[{"count":18,"href":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7664\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":7706,"href":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7664\/revisions\/7706"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/7690"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=7664"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=7664"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=7664"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}